tests/Corpus/data/rust-rrule/cases.json contains test vectors derived from
rust-rrule (https://github.com/fmeringdal/rust-rrule), commit
1c3420ede20e6190040804121e1b5e1eddac6493, files
rrule/src/tests/rfc_tests.rs and rrule/src/tests/daylight_saving.rs.

rust-rrule is dual-licensed "MIT OR Apache-2.0". This project uses the
vectors under the MIT licence. The copyright notice and the permission
notice of rust-rrule (LICENSE-MIT) follow.

tools/extract_rust_rrule.py converted the Rust test code to JSON. It changed
the format of the expected values only (RFC 3339 to iCalendar basic format
with a UTC offset suffix).

